  "review_scope": "Red with darker paired triangular/polygonal tessellation, plain red cuffs and white ring. Large observed triangles are reconstructed as flat tonal closed shapes; their fine dot screen is reduced, without tracing fabric shadows. Colors are visual estimates. Common-silhouette adaptation preserves the original PNG fabric/alpha and physical round collar.",
